{"notice_id":23528675,"sections":[{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-1","values":[{"field_id":"TED-AC_PRICE","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"code":"90410000","field_id":"TED-CPV_CODE","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"},{"code":"90430000","field_id":"TED-CPV_CODE","ordinal":1,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"TED-DATE_END","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2027-03-31"},{"field_id":"TED-DATE_START","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-04-01"},{"field_id":"TED-ITEM","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"1"},{"field_id":"TED-MAIN_SITE","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Kupferstadt Stolberg (Rhld.) Rathausstr. 11 - 13 52222 Stolberg Sonstige Erfüllungsorte sind die jeweiligen Grundstücke, auf denen sich die zu entleerenden Grundstücksentwässerungsanlagen befinden."},{"field_id":"TED-NO_ACCEPTED_VARIANTS","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"TED-NO_EU_PROGR_RELATED","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"code":"DEA2D","field_id":"TED-NUTS","ordinal":0,"scheme":"nuts","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"TED-OPTIONS","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"TED-OPTIONS_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Verlängerungsoption um 1 Jahr"},{"field_id":"TED-RENEWAL","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"TED-RENEWAL_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Verlängerungsoption um 1 Jahr: Die Laufzeit des Vertrages verlängert sich um ein Jahr, wenn nicht 6 Monate vor dem Ablauf (also spätestens am 30.09.2026) von einer Partei schriftlich per Einschreiben gekündigt wird."},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Zu entleeren sind insgesamt 115 Kleinkläranlagen und abflusslose Gruben, die sich im Gebiet der Kupferstadt Stolberg (Rhld.) im Wesentlichen auf Grundstücken in den nicht zentral gelegenen Ortsteilen verteilen."},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":1,"type":"text","value":"Für das Leistungsverzeichnis wurde hinsichtlich der gezogenen Mengen Klärschlamm aus den Kleinkläranlagen und häusliches Schmutzwasser aus den abflusslosen Gruben ein auf den Vorjahreswerten beruhender durchschnittlicher Jahreswert ermittelt, und zwar"},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":2,"type":"text","value":"-     100 m3 Klärschlamm aus den Kleinkläranlagen,"},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":3,"type":"text","value":"-  4.000 m3 häusliches Schmutzwasser aus abflusslosen Gruben."},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":4,"type":"text","value":"Bei den angegebenen Mengen handelt es sich um Richtwerte als Kalkulationsgrundlage, nicht um Mindest- bzw. Höchstmengen."},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":5,"type":"text","value":"Außerdem werden 10 Stunden pro Jahr für Noteinsatzdienste kalkuliert."}]},{"kind":"Organization","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ORG-1","values":[{"field_id":"TED-ADDRESS","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Rathausstr. 11 - 13"},{"field_id":"TED-CONTACT_POINT","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"A65.5 - Zentrale Vergabestelle"},{"code":"DE","field_id":"TED-COUNTRY","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"TED-E_MAIL","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"vergabestelle@stolberg.de"},{"field_id":"TED-FAX","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"+49 2402-99909259"},{"code":"DEA2D","field_id":"TED-NUTS","ordinal":0,"scheme":"nuts","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"TED-OFFICIALNAME","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Kupferstadt Stolberg (Rhld.)"},{"field_id":"TED-PHONE","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"+49 240213-213 / +49 240213-265 / +49 240213-504 / +49 240213-553"},{"field_id":"TED-POSTAL_CODE","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"52222"},{"field_id":"TED-TOWN","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Stolberg"},{"field_id":"TED-